00:28:24.308 --> 00:28:25.537
resonated the most with you,

00:28:25.537 --> 00:28:27.172
what lesson are you going
to take from this video

00:28:27.172 --> 00:28:29.367
and immediately apply to your life,

00:28:29.367 --> 00:28:30.770
or to your business somehow.

00:28:30.770 --> 00:28:32.420
Leave it down the comments below.

00:28:32.420 --> 00:28:34.648
I'm really curious to find
out what you have to say.

00:28:34.648 --> 00:28:36.953
I'd also like to give a quick
shout out to Matt and Dan

00:28:36.953 --> 00:28:38.534
from the Square Peg Round Hole Podcast.

00:28:38.534 --> 00:28:41.553
Thank you, guys, so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:28:41.553 --> 00:28:44.082
"Your One Word," and
having me on your podcast.

00:28:44.082 --> 00:28:45.757
It was an awesome experience,

00:28:45.757 --> 00:28:47.431
and I hope you guys enjoy my book.

00:28:47.431 --> 00:28:48.704
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:28:48.704 --> 00:28:50.067
I believe in you.

00:28:50.067 --> 00:28:52.216
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself.

00:28:52.216 --> 00:28:54.147
And, remember your one word is,

00:28:54.147 --> 00:28:55.166
much love.

00:28:55.166 --> 00:28:56.666
I'll see you soon.

00:29:02.940 --> 00:29:04.509
- I need you to do me a favor.

00:29:04.509 --> 00:29:06.822
I just need you to expect to win.

00:29:06.822 --> 00:29:08.173
Yep, yeah!

00:29:08.173 --> 00:29:09.996
You're like, "Come on, E. That's simple."

00:29:09.996 --> 00:29:13.276
Look, number one, I need
you to expect to win!

00:29:13.276 --> 00:29:16.415
When you wake up in the
morning, I expect to win.

00:29:16.415 --> 00:29:18.375
I expect it to be a great day.

00:29:18.375 --> 00:29:20.200
Listen to me very closely,

00:29:20.200 --> 00:29:23.853
I do not get up at three o'
clock in the morning to lose.

00:29:23.853 --> 00:29:26.387
I used to be a loser,
a high-school dropout.

00:29:26.387 --> 00:29:28.298
I used to be a loser, a homeless.

00:29:28.298 --> 00:29:30.738
I used to be a loser,
eating out of trash cans.

00:29:30.738 --> 00:29:33.189
Listen to me, this ain't
no feel-good stuff.

00:29:33.189 --> 00:29:34.921
I used to be a loser,

00:29:34.921 --> 00:29:37.850
now, listen to me, all I do is win.

00:29:37.850 --> 00:29:40.102
And the first thing I did, I said,

00:29:40.102 --> 00:29:43.312
"Look, it's unacceptable.
I will not be a loser."

00:29:43.312 --> 00:29:46.914
All I did was say to
myself, "I expect to win!"

00:29:46.914 --> 00:29:49.173
Listen to me, when I get up at
three o' clock in the morning

00:29:49.173 --> 00:29:51.240
I expect it to be a great day.

00:29:51.240 --> 00:29:53.914
When I grind, I expect to win!

00:29:53.914 --> 00:29:56.213
When I wake up, I expect a miracle.

00:29:56.213 --> 00:29:57.942
I expect that phone call.

00:29:57.942 --> 00:30:00.683
I expected to have marital bliss.

00:30:00.683 --> 00:30:02.080
I had kids,

00:30:02.080 --> 00:30:04.662
I expected to have a great
relationship with my kids.

00:30:04.662 --> 00:30:08.832
When I went to school to get
my PhD, I expected to pass.

00:30:08.832 --> 00:30:10.412
Are you hearing what I'm telling you?

00:30:10.412 --> 00:30:12.767
I wake up every day and I expect it!

00:30:12.767 --> 00:30:14.155
All I need you to do,
(motivational music)

00:30:14.155 --> 00:30:15.807
don't practice to fail!

00:30:15.807 --> 00:30:17.780
Are you practicing to fail?

00:30:17.780 --> 00:30:19.794
Are you going to class all the time,

00:30:19.794 --> 00:30:21.523
doing all your homework to fail?

00:30:21.523 --> 00:30:23.800
So, number one, mental toughness.

00:30:23.800 --> 00:30:26.450
Everything you put your hands forth to do,

00:30:26.450 --> 00:30:29.991
expect to be successful,
expect it to be positive.

00:30:29.991 --> 00:30:31.736
When you set up for a goal,

00:30:31.736 --> 00:30:33.146
expect that it's going to happen.

00:30:33.146 --> 00:30:34.536
That's all I need you to do.

00:30:34.536 --> 00:30:36.934
Number one, expect it to happen!

00:30:36.934 --> 00:30:38.957
What if I told you that you'll never ever

00:30:38.957 --> 00:30:40.924
have to come up short again?
(crowd cheering)

00:30:40.924 --> 00:30:43.325
So, this is all I need
you to do for me today.

00:30:43.325 --> 00:30:46.105
Listen to me, this is all I
need you to do for me today,

00:30:46.105 --> 00:30:47.868
is that you declare that it's over!

00:30:47.868 --> 00:30:51.704
That yesterday was the last
day that you were a loser.

00:30:51.704 --> 00:30:54.831
Like yesterday was the last
day you expected to lose.

00:30:54.831 --> 00:30:57.798
Like yesterday was the
last day you expected,

00:30:57.798 --> 00:30:59.661
listen to me, to come up short.

00:30:59.661 --> 00:31:03.877
All I need you to do is declare
for me like, losing is over.

00:31:03.877 --> 00:31:06.524
All I need you to do is speak up and say,

00:31:06.524 --> 00:31:08.107
"I expect to win"!

